      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-guts-2006-p3.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The probability that any given baby goes unpoked is \\(1 / 4\\). So the answer is \\(2006 / 4=1003 / 2\\).",
